  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEDP 3 RBM-TA Sida-ADB Administration Agreement</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PEDP 3 RBM-TA Sida-ADB Administration Agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

The objective/purpose of this RBM TA as per the government&#x2019;s request is to further build and strengthen the Government&#x2019;s capacity, specifically, that of the Directorate of Primary Education (DPE) and the Ministry of Primary &amp; Mass Education (MOPME) to operationalize and institutionalise the RBM approach under PEDP 3.
The specific objectives are: i. report results from the implementation of the programme in a
timely, clear and effective manner; ii. use of the information to feed into an evidence-based annual
operational planning process and; iii) institutionalise the RBM approach at the central and local
levels on a sustainable basis wherein the government can manage the process. Please see detailed
TOR dated August 2012 ( uploaded) for specific tasks/results to achieve the objectives which will be
monitored and reported by the Monitoring &amp; Evaluation Division ( M&amp;E Division) of the DPE through
the Annual Sector Performance Reports based on the Annual School Census Reports, and the
Disbursement Linked Indicators Reports. In conclusion, the above objectives based on the past
inputs of the RBM-TA also indicated in the above TOR are in line with the intended results of PEDP
3, and are consistent with the Swedish strategy objectives for quality education for all children in
Bangladesh with a focus on girls.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The PEDP 3 Results Based Management (RBM) Technical Assistance (TA)to the government&apos;s PEDP 2 and PEDP 3 so far has been provided by Sida   to carry out the tasks of results reporting and evidence based        planning in these programmes. The Sida contract C00952 for the above  was completed October 2012, and the government has requested Sida for more RBMTA in PEDP 3 which will be done through a Sida-ADB Admin. Agr</narrative>
  </description>
